  {
   "type": "pub-hero",
   "title": "不用出门，家就是最好的游乐场 ",
   "texts": [
    "<p>宅家的日子，娃除了头两天愿意乖乖配合，后面就关不住了。很多家长不得不祭出智能手机大法，来换取片刻的安宁。一边担忧着娃的视力和大脑发育，一边挠头，痛恨自己不能在家变个游乐场出来......</p>",
    "不用出门，家就是最好的游乐场",
    "normal"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/a0/a2/a0a2b5741ec29404989a165215eda8fe.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/a0/a2/a0a2b5741ec29404989a165215eda8fe.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<h4><strong>其实没有这么难！</strong></h4>\n<h4><strong>轻松几招，就能让家变成&ldquo;游乐场&rdquo;</strong></h4>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/20/03/20033e789fe1217008bccceac261f824.jpg"
