   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "<h3><strong>&ldquo;灌篮高手&rdquo;</strong></h3>\n<p>只要一小个空间，就可以玩的投篮游戏。柔软的布球，可以尽情玩耍，不用担心砸倒东西或邻居投诉噪音。</p>",
    "pub-text",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/a7/67/a76786f67d6a01a2cb4bce8605b3938e.jpg",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/43/f0/43f04c2c52a67bea6d5e1ed43e86a24a.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/a7/67/a76786f67d6a01a2cb4bce8605b3938e.jpg",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/43/f0/43f04c2c52a67bea6d5e1ed43e86a24a.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "80393819",
    "<p>&ldquo;投篮&rdquo;用的不一定是球，还可以是毛绒玩具，甚至换洗衣物...... 可以由爹妈抱着&ldquo;球篮&rdquo;移动，让娃也动起来，锻炼效果更佳哦！</p>"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/40/42/4042694553d56ff33623ada0256647ea.jpg",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/03/81/038130b0e19f72e1accbdc7117106eba.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
